    {
      "id": "rocketmq-23",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "事务消息流程是生产者先发送half message，broker保存half message并标记为不可投递后返回ACK；生产者随后执行本地事务，再发送第二次ACK提交Commit或Rollback结果。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "rocketmq-transactions",
          "start": 31,
          "end": 34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rocketmq-24",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "broker返回ACK时half message仍不可投递，且在Transaction pending阶段对下游消费者不可见；只有收到第二次ACK且结果为Commit后，broker才将其标记为可投递并交付消费者。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "rocketmq-transactions",
          "start": 32,
